    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nEmmyLua widens singleton completion and symbol tags to integer during generic inference. Nested field checking can skip the resulting type mismatch depending on member iteration order, making lint flaky.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nAnnotate both tag tables with their protocol types so `get_value_set()` preserves the singleton tag types without changing runtime behavior or disabling diagnostics.\r\n\r\nValidated with 1,000 consecutive full-runtime checks using EmmyLua 0.25.1 on macOS arm64.",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-27T11:36:30Z",
